OL,9,G0232FAssignment
OL,10,     GIceland is one of the few nations
OL,11,     Gwithout a national military. Its
OL,12,     Gsecurity relies on international
OL,13,     Galliances and a civilian defence
OL,14,     Gforce. Is this a sustainable
OL,15,     Gstrategy?
