OL,17,G0306FOutlook
OL,18,     GJuan Catalan was facing the death
OL,19,     Gpenalty for a murder he didn't
OL,20,     Gcommit. There was one man he
OL,21,     Gthought could save him: US
OL,22,     Gcomedian Larry David.
