OL,4,G0350FWitness History
OL,5,     GIn 1982, Paraguay and Brazil
OL,6,     Gclosed the gates of the Itaipu
OL,7,     GDam to fill its reservoir. But as
OL,8,     Gthe water rose, thousands of
OL,9,     Ganimals had to be rescued as
OL,10,     Gtheir habitat was flooded.
